ineering — powering NexFix, Exora, and AarVed from one shared platform core.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"AarGa — One Ecosystem. Two Missions.\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"AarGa unifies social impact with enterprise engineering.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://aarga.org\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"AarGa\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://aarga.org/aarga-logo.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"AarGa Ecosystem Logo\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"AarGa — One Ecosystem. Two Missions.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"AarGa unifies social impact with enterprise engineering.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://aarga.org/aarga-logo.png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"AarGa Ecosystem Logo\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/aarga-logo.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/aarga-logo.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/aarga-logo.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-paper text-ink antialiased selection:bg-emerald-200\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 -mb-[72px] bg-transparent border-b border-transparent shadow-none\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 lg:px-8\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"AarGa Logo\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain shrink-0 h-8 w-8\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">Aar<span class=\"text-emerald-600\">Ga</span></span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-1 md:flex\"><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/ecosystem\">Ecosystem</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/tech\">Tech Hub</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/interns\">Verified Interns</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-glass transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] hover:bg-moss-800\" href=\"/admin\">Founder Sign In<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><button aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 md:hidden\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Menu</span><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><span class=\"block h-0.5 w-5 bg-ink transition-transform \"></span><span class=\"block h-0.5 w-5 bg-ink transition-opacity \"></span><span class=\"block h-0.5 w-5 bg-ink transition-transform \"></span></div></button></div></header><div class=\"min-h-screen\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-paper\" style=\"--mx:50%;--my:20%\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-40\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(15,122,72,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(15,122,72,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"matrix-spotlight\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center px-6 py-28 text-center lg:py-36\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-700 animate-fade-up\">Grassroots Roots · Enterprise Grade</span><h1 class=\"mt-6 text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl text-balance animate-fade-up\">One Ecosystem.<br/><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-moss-700 via-emerald-600 to-moss-700 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Two Missions.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 text-balance animate-fade-up\">AarGa runs a foundation and a SaaS platform on the same infrastructure — NexFix handles operations &amp; finance, Exora handles secure examinations &amp; academic integrity, and AarVed handles education &amp; student learning.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row animate-fade-up\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-glass-lg transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] hover:bg-moss-800\" href=\"/tech\">Explore Tech Hub<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-ink px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-ink hover:text-white\" href=\"/ecosystem\">Explore Ecosystem</a></div><p class=\"mt-8 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\">AarGa Foundation &amp; AarGa Private Limited</p></div></div></div><section id=\"mission\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border p-8 shadow-glass border-moss-200 bg-moss-50/60\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-moss-700\">Mission One</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">The Foundation</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">AarGa began as a grassroots foundation working alongside cooperatives, field technicians, and community lenders who had no software built for how they actually operate. Every tool traces back to a real problem logged in the field, not a whiteboard.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink\">12</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500\">Partner organizations onboarded</span></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border p-8 shadow-glass border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-700\">Mission Two</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">The Platform</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">To sustain that work without depending on grant cycles, AarGa built a commercial SaaS layer on the same infrastructure — enterprise customers fund the platform core that the foundation&#x27;s partners run on for free or at cost.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink\">99.9%</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500\">Platform-wide uptime SLA</span></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden mt-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 p-8 shadow-glass md:p-10\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-2 -top-6 select-none font-serif text-9xl font-black text-slate-100/80\">“</span><div class=\"relative z-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[auto,1fr] md:items-center\"><div class=\"flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-ink text-2xl font-black text-white shadow-md\">AG</div><div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\">Founder Story Snapshot</span><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-5xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">“We didn&#x27;t set out to build a corporate software company. We set out to help students and communities—starting from grassroots education through AarVedics at age 15. Every platform since—NexFix, Exora, AarVed—is simply that same instinct, applied to the next real-world problem a partner brought to our door.”           </p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500\">Founding Team, AarGa</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"ecosystem\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end\"><div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600\">The Ecosystem</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl text-balance\">Three products.<!-- --> One shared platform core.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg text-slate-600\">Every tile below is a live product built on the same identity, ledger, and telemetry primitives — pulled here from a single ecosystem data source.</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-ink hover:text-white\" href=\"/tech\">View full Tech Hub →</a></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><a id=\"nexfix\" class=\"bento-tile group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 glass p-6 shadow-glass ring-1 ring-moss-200/70 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(15,122,72,0.35)] md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2\" href=\"/tech#nexfix\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-50\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #0F7A48, transparent 70%)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-moss-100 text-moss-800\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-moss-600\"></span>Operations &amp; Finance</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\">GA</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">NexFix</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Dispatch and repair-network orchestration for hardware fleets.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 border-t border-slate-200/70 pt-4 font-mono\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">uptime</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">99.9%</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">avg Resolve</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">6.2h</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">techs Active</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">3,400+</div></div></div></a><a id=\"exora\" class=\"bento-tile group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 glass p-6 shadow-glass ring-1 ring-emerald-200/70 hover:shadow-glow-emerald md:col-span-1 md:row-span-2\" href=\"/tech#exora\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-50\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #10B981, transparent 70%)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Secure Examinations &amp; Academic Integrity</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\">GA</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">Exora</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Impact analytics, proctored assessment, and integrity verification.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 border-t border-slate-200/70 pt-4 font-mono\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">uptime</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">99.95%</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">dashboards</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">2,100+</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">data Points</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">48M/mo</div></div></div></a><a id=\"aarved\" class=\"bento-tile group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 glass p-6 shadow-glass ring-1 ring-gold-400/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(217,164,65,0.4)] md:col-span-1 md:row-span-2\" href=\"/tech#aarved\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-50\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #D9A441, transparent 70%)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-gold-400/20 text-gold-600\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold-500\"></span>Education &amp; Student Learning</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\">Alpha</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">AarVed</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Interactive learning pathways, skill tracking, and student telemetry.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 border-t border-slate-200/70 pt-4 font-mono\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">uptime</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">99.8%</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">courses Live</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">42</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">students Enrolled</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">1,200+</div></div></div></a></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-ink px-8 py-14 text-center shadow-glass-lg md:px-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl text-balance\">Ready to see the platform behind the mission?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-300\">Walk through the full engineering lifecycle, explore the Ecosystem Command Center, or meet the verified interns shipping inside it right now.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-500 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-ink shadow-glow-emerald transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03]\" href=\"/ecosystem\">Explore Ecosystem</a><a class=\"rounded-full border-2 border-white/30 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:border-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tech\">Explore Tech Hub</a></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class=\"border-t border-slate-200 bg-white/60\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><img alt=\"AarGa Logo\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" c